<title>USA: Omaha hogs $2.00 higher  - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $2.00 higher  - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $2.00 higher.</p>
<p>Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3    220-260 lbs    58.50-59.00</p>
<p>US  2-3    260-280 lbs    57.50-58.50</p>
<p>	     330-392 lbs    46.50-55.50</p>
<p>Sows: 25 percent. Firm to 2.00 higher. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     350-500 lbs    46.00-46.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     500-650 lbs    48.00-49.00</p>
